        "name2": "char_459_tachak_1#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "What's the situation?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tachanka"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_503_rang",
        "name2": "char_459_tachak_1#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "They've been pushed back, for now. But they'll come for us again before long.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rangers"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_458_rfrost_1#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "There... seems to be less of them?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frost"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm all out of 'welcome mats.' Ammo's gone too.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frost"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_458_rfrost_1#3",
        "name2": "char_459_tachak_1#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "What's the plan, Alexsandr?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frost"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_458_rfrost_1#3",
        "name2": "char_459_tachak_1#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Get to the shelter.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tachanka"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_458_rfrost_1#3",
        "name2": "char_459_tachak_1#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "What?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frost"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_458_rfrost_1#3",
        "name2": "char_459_tachak_1#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Get to the shelter! Take the Rhodes Island Operators and get to shelter!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tachanka"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_458_rfrost_1#3",
        "name2": "char_459_tachak_1#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "What about you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frost"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_458_rfrost_1#3",
        "name2": "char_459_tachak_1#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I'll cover you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tachanka"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_458_rfrost_1#3",
        "name2": "char_459_tachak_1#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Cover? And who's covering you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frost"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_458_rfrost_1#3",
        "name2": "char_459_tachak_1#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't need cover.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tachanka"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_458_rfrost_1#4",
        "name2": "char_459_tachak_1#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Hey! Get it together! Alexsandr!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frost"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_459_tachak_1#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm all together.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tachanka"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm tired of all the hiding and running.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tachanka"
    },
    {
        "text": "Running can't win you the war. History's shown.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tachanka"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_458_rfrost_1#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "But this isn't a war.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frost"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$cherimp_intro",
        "key": "$cherimp_loop",
        "volume": 0.4
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_459_tachak_1#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "It is to me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tachanka"
    },
    {
        "text": "When they pull weapons on the Infected and try to kill my friends, it's a war.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tachanka"
    },
    {
        "text": "I've been through plenty of wars in my time.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tachanka"
    },
    {
        "text": "If I can kill even one more *profanity* monster here, it'll give the townsfolk a better shot at survival.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tachanka"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'll make my stand here until I run out of ammo. Until the very end.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tachanka"
    },
    {
        "text": "The battle's not over. How could I retreat?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tachanka"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_458_rfrost_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're the one who says not to play hero!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frost"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_459_tachak_1#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't think I'm playing hero, Tina.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tachanka"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm just doing the right thing.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tachanka"
    },
    {
        "text": "No matter what happens, the show ends here, today.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tachanka"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_458_rfrost_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "Alexsandr! !",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frost"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_458_rfrost_1#4",
        "name2": "char_503_rang",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm staying too.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rangers"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_458_rfrost_1#3",
        "name2": "char_503_rang",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "But why...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frost"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_458_rfrost_1#3",
        "name2": "char_503_rang",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "It was always going to turn out like this. We all knew it, from the moment you decided to stay and fight.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rangers"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'll stay behind and help the warrior hold them back. And if things go bad, I'll cover his retreat.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rangers"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_458_rfrost_1#3",
        "name2": "char_503_rang",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Mr. Rangers...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frost"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
