        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_503_rang",
        "name2": "char_459_tachak_1#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm so much older and slower than I was.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rangers"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_503_rang",
        "name2": "char_459_tachak_1#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "But the blade, she's as sharp as ever.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tachanka"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_503_rang",
        "name2": "char_459_tachak_1#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I still don't know your name, warrior.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rangers"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_503_rang",
        "name2": "char_459_tachak_1#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Alexsandr Senaviev.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tachanka"
    },
    {
        "text": "You can call me Alexsandr.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tachanka"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_503_rang",
        "name2": "char_459_tachak_1#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I should tell you my name too.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rangers"
    },
    {
        "text": "But the sands buried my name the day we stained the valley red with blood, along with the past.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rangers"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_503_rang",
        "name2": "char_459_tachak_1#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "It's fine.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tachanka"
    },
    {
        "text": "You decided to stay and fight. That's what matters.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tachanka"
    },
    {
        "text": "'Rangers'.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tachanka"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_459_tachak_1#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "'They told me I'd died. They were wrong. I was reborn. '",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tachanka"
    },
    {
        "text": "No matter how many of those monsters there are.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tachanka"
    },
    {
        "text": "Let them come.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tachanka"
